<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of games played in the</p>
<p>Spanish first division on Sunday:</p>
<p>Athletic Bilbao 3 (Carlos Garcia 51st minute, Joseba Ziganda</p>
<p>68th, Jose Mari 74th) Rayo Vallecano 2 (Guilherme 39th, Ameli</p>
<p>72nd). 0-1. 40,000.</p>
<p>Celta 1 (Juan Sanchez 87th) Deportivo Coruna 1 (Jose Tarraga,</p>
<p>own goal, 18th). 0-1. 27,000.</p>
<p>Sevilla 1 (Ivica Mornar 90th) Zaragoza 2 (Gustavo Lopez 42nd,</p>
<p>Fernando Morientes 47th). 0-1. 49,000.</p>
<p>Sporting Gijon 0 Racing Santander 1 (Alvaro Cervera 34th). 0-1.</p>
<p>28,000.</p>
<p>Valladolid 0 Oviedo 1 (Toni Velamazan 90th). 0-0. 22,000.</p>
<p>Real Madrid 3 (Mijatovic 15th, Raul 35th, 71st) Hercules 0.</p>
<p>2-0. 60,000.</p>
